<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Hebrai</book>
  <para style="h">Hebrai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hebrai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebrai</para>
  <para style="mt">Hebrai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tûn hma hun zawng khân kawng tinrêngin Pathian chuan kan pi pute hnênah zâwlneite hmangin thu a sawi ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tûn hun hnuhnûngah hian kan hnênah Fapain thu a rawn sawi ta thung a ni; Ani chu a ro zawng zawng luahtuah a ruat a, amah hmangin lei leh vân hi a siam a, Ani chu a ropuina êng leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a zepui putu a ni bawk; engkim hi a thiltihtheihnain a khai ding a, sual faina kawng a siam hnuin Chungnungbera ding lamah khian a han ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vântirhkohte hming aia hming ropui a nei ta a; tichuan, anni ai chuan a ropui zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vântirhkoh zînga tu hnênah nge, “Nang zawng ka Fapa i ni e, vawiin hian Fapaah ka nei ta che,” emaw, “A tân Pa ka ni ang a, Ka tân fapa a ni ang,” a tih ngai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fa tîra erawh chu khawvêla a rawn tirh khân, “Pathian vântirhkoh zawng zawngin ani chu chibai bûk rawh se,” a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vântirhkoh chungchâng a sawi chuan, “Vântirhkoh chu thli-ah a chantîr a, A rawngbâwltute chu meialhah a chantîr,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Fapa thu a sawi erawh chuan heti hian a ti: “Aw Pathian, i lalṭhutthlêng chu a awm kumkhua ang. I ram rorêlna chu rorêlna dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Felna i ngaina a, dik lo i hua a, Chuvângin, Pathian, i Pathian chuan I ṭhiante aiin duhsakna hriak a thih ta bîk che a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Heti pawh hian a ti bawk: “Aw Lalpa, a tîrah nangin lei hi i siam a, Vânte pawh khi i kutchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûngte chu an la boral ang a, Nang erawh chu i awm reng ang. Chûng zawng zawngte chu silhfên angin an la hlui ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puan angin i zial ang a, Silhfên angin i la thlâk ang. Nang zawng i ngai reng a, Kin ni i nei lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vântirhkoh zînga tu hnênah nge, “Ka ding lamah lo ṭhu rawh, I hmêlmate I ke nghahchhanah ka han siam ang e,” a tih ngai?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vântirhkoh zawng, thlarau chhandamna changtute rawngbâwlsak tûra tirh an ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuvângin, kan thu dawnte kha kan pawisa lehzual tûr a ni, chuti lo zawng kan tawlh bo hlauh dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vântirhkoh hmanga thu sawi mah a ngheh êm êma, a bawhchhetu leh pawisa lotu rêng rêng an phu tâwka hrem an nih zêl si chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />heti kauva chhandamna pawimawh hi kan thlahthlam vaih chuan, engtin nge hrem kan pumpelh theih tehlul ang? Chu chhandamna chu Lalpa ngeiin a rawn puang hmasa a, a thu dawngtute khân min nemnghehsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian meuh pawhin chhinchhiahna te, thil mak te leh thiltih ropui tak te tiin, Thlarau Thianghlim thilpêk chu ṭûl a tih ang zêla semin a rawn nemnghet bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawvêl lo la awm tûr chu vântirhkohte thuhnuaiah a dah lo tih kan sawi a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu emaw chuan hetiang hian khawiah emaw a sawi: “Mihring hi eng nge maw a niha, i hriat reng ṭhin ni? Mihring Fapa pawh hi eng nge maw a niha, i ngaihtuah ṭhin ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chu vântirhkohte aia hnuaiin i siam rih a, Ropuina leh chawimawina i khumtîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a ke hnuaiah engkim i dah a,” tiin. “A ke hnuaiah engkim i dah,” tih hian engkim takmeuh a huam a ni; amaherawhchu, tûnah engkim a hnuaia awmin kan la hre rih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, Isua, “Vântirhkohte aia hnuaia siam rih” chu thihna tuar avânga ropuina leh chawimawina khumtîr a ni ta tih kan hmu, Pathian khawngaihna azârah mi tin tân thihna a temsak ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ropuina chang ve tûra fa tam tak hruai lûttu, an chhandamna siamtu, a zâra engkim awma, a tâna engkim awm bawka tân chuan, tuarnate avânga tihfamkima a awm chu a âwm rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tithianghlimtu leh tihthianghlimte chu Pa thuhmun aṭanga chhuak an ni; chuvângin, anniho chu ‘unaute,’ tih a zak lo ve:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ka unaute hnênah i hming ka lam ang a. Kohhran zîngah i fak hla ka sa ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Amahah ka rinna ka nghat ang,” pawh a ti a. “En teh, kei leh Pathian mi pêk naupangte hi,” a ti bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Naupang a tihte hi tisa leh thisen nei an ni a, ani pawh chutiang chu a lo ni ve ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, thihna chunga thuneitu Diabola chu, a thihna avângin a titlâwm a, dam chhûnga thih hlau rêng rênga awm ṭhîn, hlauhna bawiha tângte chu a chhuah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A rawn ngaihsakte hi vântirhkoh an ni lo, Abrahama thlahte an ni a rawn ngaihsakte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, min lainattu, Pathian tâna Puithiam lalber rinawm tak, mi zawng zawng sual thuphachawina hlântu ni tûr chu, kawng engkima a unaute anga a lo awm a ṭûl rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah ngei chu thlêmna tuar chhuak tawh a nih avângin thlêmna tuarte pawh a ṭanpui thei a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, unau thianghlim, vân kohna chang vete u, kan thurina Tirhkoh leh Puithiam lalber, Isua chu ngaihtuah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian chhûngkaw pum pui tân Mosia a rinawm ang bawkin ani pawh a ruattu tân a rinawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhûngkaw dintu chu a chhûngte aiin an chawimawi zâwk ang hian, Isua pawh Mosia aia ropuina nasa zâwk hmu tlâk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhûngkaw tin hi tu din emaw an ni vek a; engkim dintu chu Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosia chu chhiahhlawh niin Pathian chhûngkaw pum pui tân a rinawm a, Pathian thu sawi puang chhâwngtu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista erawh chu Fapa niin Pathian chhûngkaw tân a rinawm a ni; keini hi a chhûngte chu kan ni, kan beiseina ngaihṭhatthlâk tak leh chhuanawm tak hi kan chelh tlat phawt chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, Thlarau Thianghlimin heti hian a ti: “Vawiin hian a aw in hriat chuan Thlalêra mi fiah lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hel lai nî ang khân In thinlung tikhauh suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kum sawmli chhûng in pi puten Ka thiltihte hmu chungin mi chhin a, mi fiah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, chu chhuanho chungah chuan ka thinur ta a, An rilruin a hruai pêng a, Ka kawng pawh an hre ta lo; ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thinur taka ka tiam tâk ang khân Ka chawlhnaah an luh ka phal lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Unaute u, fîmkhur rawh u, chuti lo chuan Pathian nung tlûksan tûrin tu thinlungah emaw rin lohna sual a lo lût dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Vawiin,’ tih a nih chhûng hian in zînga tu mah suala an tlûka, an thinlung an tihkhauh loh nân nî tin infuih tawn zâwk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tîra kan rinna kha a tâwp thlenga kan vawn tlat phawt chuan Krista ṭâwmpuitute kan ni asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘Vawiin hian a aw in hriat chuan, hel lai ni ang khân In thinlung tikhauh suh u,’ tih a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nih leh tute nge hre reng chunga hel kha? Aigupta ram aṭanga Mosia hruai chhuahte kha an ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum sawmli chhûng khân tute chungah nge a lungnih loh kha? Thil sual titute, thlalêra tlu hlum tate chungah khân a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu awih lote chungah chauh lo chuan tu hnênah nge a chawlhnaa lût lo tûra thu a tiam le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, an rin loh avângin an lût ve thei ta lo tih kan hria.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A chawlhnaa luh theihna thutiam a la din reng chhûng hian in zîngah tlai lutuk ta nia inngai in awm hlauh vang tih a hlauhawm a nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Annihovin Chanchin Ṭha an hriat ang bawkin keini pawhin kan hre ve ta a. Anni chuan rinnaa ngaithlatute an rem loh avângin an thu dawn chu an sâwtpui lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keini ringtute hi a chawlhnaa lût tate chu kan ni; Pathianin lei leh vân a siam zawh khân a hna a chawlhsan nâ a, ‘Thinur taka ka tiam tâk ang khân, Ka chawlhnaah chuan an lût lo vang,’ a la ti reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ni sarih ni thu-ah chuan, ‘Pathianin a hna thawh zawng zawng ni sarih niin a chawlhsan ta a,’ tiin khawiah emaw ziak a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Ka chawlhnaah chuan an lût lo vang,’ tih thu-ah hian a ṭhen lût tûr an awm tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha hre hmasate khân an rin loh avângin an lût thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kan sawi tâk, ‘Vawiin hian a aw in hriat chuan in thinlung tikhauh suh u,’ tih hi Davida sawitîrin kum tam tak hnuah Pathian chuan ni dang, ‘vawiin’ a tih chu a rawn ruat leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josua khân ‘chawlhnaah’ chuan hruai lût ni se, Pathianin hun dang a ruat leh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, Pathian mite tân chawlhna hun dang a la awm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathianin a hnathawh a chawlhsan ang bawkin Pathian tiam chawlhna changte chu an thawhrimna ata an la châwl dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Rin loh avânga an tlu ang khân tu mah kan tlûk ve loh nân, chu chawlhnaa lût tûr chuan theihtâwp i chhuah ṭheuh vang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian thu chu a nung a, thil a ti thei a, khandaih hriam tawn eng anga hriam ai pawhin a hriam zâwk a, ruhtuah leh thlîng te, nunna leh thlarau inzawmnate a phel hrang thei a, rilrua ngaihtuah leh tumte pawh a hre nghâl thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mit hmuha lang lo thil siam rêng rêng a awm lo. Kan chanchin kan sawina tûra mit hmuhah chuan engkim hi saruak leh inhawng sa a ni vek zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, vânahte kal tlang tawh Puithiam lalber ropui tak, Isua, Pathian Fapa chu, kan neih avângin kan thurin hi i vuan tlat ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan Puithiam lalber neih hi kan chak lohnate min hriatpui pha lo a ni lo va, keimahni ang bawka kawng tinrênga thlêmna tâwk tawh, sual si lo chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, puih kan ngaih hun taka zahngaihna leh khawngaihna kan hmuh theihna tûrin, khawngaihna lalṭhutthlêng chu huai takin i hnaih ang u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Puithiam lalberte chu mihring zîng ata thlan chhuah an ni ziah ṭhîn, mihring tân Pathian lama rawngbâwl tûra ruat an ni a, thilpêkte leh sual tâna inthawinate hlân tûra tih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anni pawh chu chak lohna hual vêla awm ve bawk an nih avângin, hre lote leh bawhchhiate an dîm thiam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi dangte tân sual thawina an hlansak ang bawkin, anmahni tân pawh an hlân ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu man hetiang inchawimawina hi mahni an inkhumtîr ngai lo va, Arona anga Pathian kohte chauhvin an khum zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin, Krista pawh chu mahni inchawimawiin Puithiam lalberah a insiam lo. “Nang zawng ka Fapa i ni e. Vawiin hian fapaah ka neih ta che,” titu khân a ruat zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmun dangah pawh, “Nang zawng Melkisedeka puithiamna ang chi-a chatuan puithiam i ni e,” a ti bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chuan a tisa put lai nite khân thihna laka amah chhan theitu hnênah nasa taka au leh mittui tla chunga dîlin a ṭawngṭai a. Pathian a ṭih ṭhin avângin a dîlna chu ngaihthlâk a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Fapa meuh pawh ni mah sela, a thil tuarahte chuan thu awih a zir ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tihfamkima lo awmin, a thu awih zawng zawngte tân chatuan chhandamna bulpui a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Melkisedeka puithiamna ang chî-a Puithiam lalberah Pathianin a ruat ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu mi chungchângah chuan sawi tûr tam tak kan nei a, in la mâwl êm avângin hrilh fiah pawh a harsa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hun ngaihtuah chuan zirtîrtu ni tawh hial âwm in ni na a. Pathian thu chu a bul rêt aṭanga zirtîr in ngai leh ta a ni. Chaw tak ni lovin hnutetui in la mamawh a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnute hne laite chu nausên an la nih avângin chaw tak, felna thu chu an la ei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chaw tak erawh chu puitling tân a ni. Chûngte chuan a chhia leh a ṭha thliar thiam tûrin an rilru an sawizawi tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, Krista chungchânga zirtîrna thu mâwl tê tê chu sawi tawh lovin puitlin lam i pan ang u; thiltih sâwt lo bânsan thu te, Pathian rin thu te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />baptisma thu te, kut nghah thu te, mitthi thawhlehna thu te leh chatuan rorêl inzirtîrna thu te sawi nawn sawi nawn tawh lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathianin rem a tih chuan chu chu tih kan tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tihêna awm tawh, vân thilpêk tema, Thlarau Thianghlim pawh chang ve tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian thu tuina leh khawvêl lo la awm tûr thiltihtheihna tem tawh zeta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tlûksan leh tate chu sim tûra hruai kîr leh rual an ni tawh lo; anmahni ngeiin Pathian Fapa chu khêngbet nawn lehin an timualpho va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lo, a chunga ruahtui tla ṭhîn lo dawnga, a neitu tâna thlai ei tlâk chhuah ta chu Pathianin mal a sâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, hnim leh hlîngte chauh chhuah chu mâkin a lo awm a, ânchhe dawn hmabâk a lo ni a, a tâwpah hâl a tâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Duh takte u, chutiang thu chu sawi mah ila nangni zawng in dinhmun a ṭhat zâwka, chhandam in nih ngei ka ring tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In thil tih ṭhin, tûnah pawh in la tih zêl ṭhin, a hming vânga hmangaihna in lantîr te leh, mi thianghlimte rawng in bâwlsak ṭhin te hi theihnghilh mai tûrin Pathian chu mi fel lo a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu pawhin in beiseina hi a thlen famkim hma chuan taihmâk in chhuah zêl ka duh êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dâwngdah lova ring tlat leh dawhthei taka nghâk fan fan ṭhîn, Pathian thutiam changtute anga in awm kan duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathianin Abrahama hnêna thu a tiam lai khân, a aia ropui zâwk chhâl tûr an awm loh avângin amah leh amah inchhâlin thu a tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Matheilovin mal ka sâwm ang chia, ka tipung ngei ngei ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Abrahama chuan a nghâk fan fan a, Pathian thiltiam chu a dawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihringte chuan anmahni aia ropui zâwk chhâlin chhia an chham ṭhîn, chutiang chhechham chuan thu inchuh a titâwp a, a tinghet ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian pawhin a thutiam a sût loh tûrzia entîr nân thutiam dawng tûrte hnênah mahni inchhâl meuhvin a nemnghet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sût leh mai mai loh chi hêng thil pahnih - thutiam leh mahni inchhâlna avâng hian, Pathian chu daw rual a ni lo ve. Chuvângin, keini, a hnêna tlânte hian him nân kan hmaa beiseina chu thlamuang takin kan chelh thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu beiseina chu kan nun thîrchakaiah kan nei a, rinawm leh nghet tak a ni; Hmun Thianghlim Berah a inthlung lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutah chuan kan tân, kan hmahruaitu Isua a lût tawh a, Melkisedeka puithiamna ang chi-a chatuan Puithiam lalber a ni ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chu Melkisedeka chu Salem khaw lal a ni a, Pathian Chungnungbera puithiam a ni bawk. Ani chuan Abrahama, lalho that lo haw kha a lo hmuak a, mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abrahama chuan ani chu a râllâk sum zawng zawng aṭang chuan sâwma pakhat a pe a. A hming awmzia hi ‘Felna lal’ tihna a ni phawt a. Salem lal a nih bawk avângin ‘Remna lal’ tihna a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chu pa nei lo, nu nei lo, thlahtu chhui tûr awm lo, a awm ṭan ni leh a nun tâwp ni sawi tûr awm lo a ni a; Pathian Fapa ang mai a ni a, puithiam a ni reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thlahtu Abrahaman a rallâk sum zawng zawng aṭanga sâwma pakhat a pêka chu a ropuizia hi ngaihtuah teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Puithiam hna chelhtu Levia thlahte chuan Dân thu angin an unau Israel mite, Abrahama thlah ve thote lakah sâwma pakhat lâk tûr thu an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Levia thlahte zînga tel ve si lo Melkisedeka chuan, Abrahama hnên aṭangin sâwma pakhat a la a, thutiam dawngtu Abrahama chu mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnial rual lohvin a tê zâwk chu a ropui zâwkin mal an sâwm ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiamte thu-ah chuan, thi thei mihringten sâwma pakhat an dawng a, Melkisedeka thu-ah erawh chuan nung renga an sawi chuan sâwma pakhat chu a dawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Levia, sâwma pakhat dawngtu ngei pawh khân Abrahama kutin Melkisedeka hnênah sâwma pakhat a pe tih theih a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Melkisedekan a lo hmuah lai khân Levia chu a pu Abrahama ṭhalbea awm a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Levia thlahte puithiam hna nêna inthlunga Dân hi pêk a ni a; chûng avânga famkim theih ni ta sela, Arona puithiamna ang chî ni lo, Melkisedeka puithiamna ang chi-a puithiam dang awm a ngai dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Puithiam hna kalhmang thlâk a nih tâk si chuan Dân pawh chu thlâk a ngai rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A chanchin kan sawia hi maichâm rawngbâwlna khawih ve ngai lo hnam zînga mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan Lalpa chu Mosian puithiam thu a sawi laia sawi tel ve ngai loh Juda hnama mi a nih chiang takin kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Puithiam chi dang, Melkisedeka ang chi, mihring Dân anga puithiam ni ve satliah lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tihchhiat rual loh nunna thu-a ruat a lo awm ta hian kan thu chu a tifiah lehzual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lehkha Thu chuan: “Melkisedeka puithiamna ang chî-a chatuan puithiam i ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thupêk hmasa chu a chak lo va, a hman tlâk loh avângin hnâwl a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dân chuan eng mah a tipuitling thei si lo. Beiseina ṭha zâwk, Pathian min hnaihtîrtu chuan a rawn thlâk ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hming chhâl meuhva a rawn thlâk a ni, puithiam dangte chu chutianga ruat an ni ve si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ani erawh hi chu hming chhâl meuhva ruat a ni, a ruattu chuan a hnênah: “Lalpan hming a chhâl, A lamlêt tawh lo vang, Nang zawng chatuan atân puithiam i ni e,” a tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, chu thuthlung, Isua ngeiin a nemngheh chu a va ropui êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Danglamna a la awm: Thihna avângin an puithiamna hna an chhunzawm kumkhua thei lo va; chuvângin, mi tam tak puithiamah siam an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani erawh hi chu a nun reng avângin a puithiamna chu thlâk theih lohvin a nghet ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Amaha Pathian hnêna kalte chu eng ang pawh a chhandam thei reng a, an tân Pathian hnêna ngensak tûrin a nung reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutiang chî Puithiam lalber chuan kan mamawh a phuhrûk zo êm êm a ni; a thianghlim a, pawi a sawi lo va, a hmêlhem lo va, mi sualte lakah a fihlîm a, vân aia sângah tûnah chawimawi a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Puithiam lalberte chuan nî tin mahni sual tân inthawina an hlân ṭhîn a, chumi zawhah mipuite sual tân an hlân ve leh ṭhîn a; ani erawh hi chuan chutianga ti ve lovin mahni a inhlân a, mi zawng zawng tân inthawina chu ṭum khatah, kumkhua atân a hlân tlingtla ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Dân chuan Puithiam lalber ni tûrin mihring chak lo tê tê a ruat ṭhîn a. Dân awm hnu daiha hming chhâla thutiam chuan Fapa, chatuan atân tihfamkim tawha chu, Puithiam lalberah a rawn ruat ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, kan thu sawi tum ber chu: chutiang Puithiam lalber chu kan nei ta tih hi a ni. Vânahte khian Ropuibera lalṭhutthlêng ding lamah a han ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim leh biakbûk tak tak, mihring sak ni lo, Lalpa sak zâwkah chuan rawng a han bâwl ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puithiam lalber te chu thilpêkte leh inthawinate hlân tûra ruat an ni a. Chuvângin, ani pawh hian eng emaw tal hlan tûr a neih a ngai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leiah hian la awm reng sela, puithiam hna rêng a thawk lo vang, Dân anga thilpêk hlântu tûrte an awm reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosian biakbûk a sak dâwn laiin Pathianin a sak dân tûr a hrilh a, “Tlânga a lem ka entîr ang chiah che khân engkim i siam tûr a ni tih hre reng rawh,” a tih ang khân hêngho rawngbâwlna hi vân thil lem leh hlimthla mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tûna ani rawngbâwlna neih tâk hi zawng, thutiam ropui zâwkah a innghat a, thuthlung ṭha lehzual a rawn thlen ang bawk hian, an rawngbâwlna ai chuan a ropui zâwk êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuthlung hmasa kha sawisêlbo ni ta sela, thlun nawn a ngai lo tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anmahni demin hetiang hian a sawi a nih zâwk kha: “Ngai teh u, nite a lo thleng dâwn,” Lalpan a ti. “Israel chhûngte leh Juda chhûngte chu Thuthlung thar ka siampui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An pi pute Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah laia, An kutte ka chelh nia, An hnêna ka thlun ang kha ni lovin, Ka thuthlungah chuan an awm reng loh avângin Anmahni ka ngaihsak ta lo va ni,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Chûng nîa Israel chhûngte hnêna thu ka thlun tûr chu hei hi a ni: An rilruah ka Dânte ka dah ang a. An thinlungah ka ziak bawk ang, An Pathian ka ni ang a, ka mite an ni bawk ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tu mahin ‘Lalpa chu hre rawh u,’ tiin, Mahni khuate leh unaute an inzirtîr tawh lo vang. A tê ber aṭangin a lian ber thlengin An za-in mi hre vek tawh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An bawhchhiatnaahte zah ka ngai ang a, An sualte pawh ka hre reng tawh lo vang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuthlung thar a sawi tâk avângin thuthlung hmasa chu a tihlui ta a, lo upaa hlui ta chu a bo thuai dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuthlung hmasaah pawh khân rawngbâwl dân tûr leh rawngbâwlna tûr Hmun Thianghlim, leia mi chu ruat a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Biakbûk an sa a, a tawntirhah chuan khâwnvâr dahna te, dawhkân, chhangdah awmna te a awm a, chu chu Hmun Thianghlim an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Puanzâr pahnihna chhûngah chuan biakbûk Hmun Thianghlim Ber an tih chu a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutah chuan rimtui hâlna rangkachak maichâm te, Thuthlung Bâwm rangkachak tia luan te a awm a. Thuthlung Bâwm chhûngah chuan mana dahna rangkachak bêl te, Arona tiang chawr te, thuthlung ziakna lung phêk te a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chungah chuan ropuina cherub-te an awm a, sual thuphachawina hmun chungah chuan an thla an zâr a. Chûng thute zawng tûnah a kip a kawiin kan sawi hman lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutianga rem chu a ni a, puithiamte chu biak bûk tawntirhah chuan an puithiam rawngbâwl hna thawkin nî tin an lût ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A dawttuah erawh chuan Puithiam lalber chauh, kum khatah vawi khat, thisen keng ngeiin a lût ṭhîn, chu chu ama tân leh mipuiten hre lova an tihsual thawi nân a hlân ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hêng thil rem dân aṭang hian biakbûk tawntirh hi a la awm chhûng chu, Hmun Thianghlim Bera luhna kawng chu a la inhawng rih lo va ni tih Thlarau Thianghlim chuan min kawhhmuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêngte hi tûn hun entîrna a ni: hêng dân anga thil hlante leh inthawina hlante hian a hlântu mipuite thinlung chu a tifamkim thei lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />chûng chu ei leh in, insil dân hrang hrang, tisa lam thil mai mai a ni a, Siamṭhatna hun thlen hmaa hman tûra tih chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Krista erawh chu thil ṭha tûna lo thleng taahte Puithiam lalber a ni ta a, a rawngbâwlna biakbûk pawh chu, mihring sak a ni lo va, he khawvêla thilsiam ang pawh hi a nih loh avângin a ropuiin a famkim zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thisen hlan pawh chu kêlpa leh bâwngtuaite thisen ni lovin, ama thisen ngei a ni a, Hmun Thianghlimah chuan vawi khat lûtin chatuan atâna tlanna a siam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kêlpate leh bâwngpate thisen leh bâwngla vâp, mi bawlhhlawhte chunga theh mahin, an tisa thiang khawpa anmahni a tihthianghlim theih si chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Krista thisen chuan a va tithianghlim zo dâwn êm! Ani chu chatuan thlarau zârah thilhlan hmêlhem lo atân Pathian hnênah amah a inhlân a, a thisen chuan Pathian rawng bâwl tûrin thiltih sâwt lo lakah kan chhia leh ṭha hriatna a tithianghlim ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hemi avâng hian Krista chu thuthlung thar palai a ni; thuthlung hmasa bawhchhiatnate laka mite a tlan chhuah theihna tûra a lo thih tâk avângin, kohte chuan chatuan roluah tûr tiam chu an chang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thurochhiah pawh hi a chhiahtu a thi tawh nge la thi lo fiah hmasak a ṭûl ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a chhiahtu a la dam chhûng chuan hman theih a la ni rih lo va, a thih hnu chauhva hman tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, thuthlung hmasa pawh kha thisena tihngheh a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dân thu-a thupêk tinrêng Mosian mipuite a hrilh lai khân, bâwngpatuai thisen chu tui nên, sâpsen nên, husop nên a la a, lehkhabu zial leh mipui zawng zawng chu a theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Hei hi in zawm tûr Pathianin in hnêna a pêk thuthlung tihnghehna thisen a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, biakbûk leh rawngbâwlna hmanrua zawng zawng pawh chutiang bawkin thisen chuan a theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dân thu ang chuan engkim deuhthaw mai hi thisena tihthianghlim tûr a ni a, thisen chhuah lovin ngaihdamna a awm thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, vân thil anpuite mah chutianga tihthianghlim chu a ṭûl a, vân thil tak takte phei chu chûng aia inthawina ṭha zâwka tihthianghlim a ṭûl ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kuta sak hmun tihthianghlim, a tak anpuiah chuan Krista chu a lût a ni lo ve, vânah khian a han lût zâwk a, tûnah kan aiawhin Pathian hmaah a han ding ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Puithiam lalber chu mahni thisen ni lo, ran thisen kenga kum tin Hmun Thianghlima a lût ṭhîn ang hian ani chu mahni inhlân nawn fo tûrin a lût ve hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuti ni suh sela leilung pian tirh aṭang khân vawi tam tak a tuar tûr a ni. Nimahsela, tûn hun tâwpah hian sual tihreh nân amah inhlân tûrin vawi khat a lo lang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihring tân vawi khat thih ruat a ni, chumi hnuah rorêlna a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin Krista pawh chu mi tam tak sualte la bo tûrin ṭum khat hlan a ni tawh a. Sualte la bo tûr ni tawh lovin, amah lo nghâktute chhandamnaa hruai lût tûrin a lo kal leh dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dân chuan thil ṭha lo awm tûrte hlimthla, a tak ni lo, a lem chauh a ken avângin, kum tina inthawina pângngai an hlan fote chuan a hlântute chu engtin mah a tifamkim thei lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tifamkim thei sela, inthawina hlântute hi tihthianghlim an nih tawha, suala inhriatna an neih tawh si loh chuan inthawina hlan an bânsan daih tawh dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutih ahnêkin he inthawina hian an sual tih kum tin a hriat nawntîr ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kêlpa leh bâwngpate thisen chuan sualte tibo thei rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, khawvêla a lo luh lai khân heti hian a ti: Inthawina leh thilhlan i duh lo va, Ka tân taksa mi buatsaihsak zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pum hâl inthawina leh sual tâna inthawina I lâwm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu veleh, keiin, “Aw Pathian, ngai teh, lehkhabu ziala ka chanchin an ziak ang khân I duhzâwng ti tûrin ka lo kal e,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hmasaa, ‘Inthawina te, thilhlan te, pum hâl inthawina leh sual tâna inthawinate i duh lo va, i lâwm hek lo,’ tih hi Dân thupêk ang taka inthawina hlan ṭhin kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Chu veleh, ngai teh, i duhzâwng ti tûrin ka lo kal e,” a tih leh tâk hi, inthawinain a rawn thlâk ta tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Isua Krista chuan Pathian duhzâwng anga, kumkhua atân ṭum khat a taksa a hlan avângin tihthianghlim kan ni ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puithiamte chuan dingin kâwla ni chhuak chhiara rawngbâwlin inthawina pângngai an hlân fo va; mahse, chûng inthawina chuan engtin mah sual a tibo thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani erawh hi chu, chatuan atân sual thawina vawi khat a hlan hnuin, Pathian ding lamah a han ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hmêlmate a ke nghahchhana siam an nih hun chu a nghâk ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vawi khat a inhlanna khân a tihthianghlimte chu chatuan atân a tifamkim ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlarau Thianghlim pawhin heti hian min hriattîr:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chûng nia an hnêna ka thuthlun tûr chu hei hi a ni,” Lalpan a ti: “An thinlungah ka Dânte ka dah ang a, An rilruah ka ziak bawk ang,” tia a sawi hnu khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“An sualte leh an bawhchhiatnate ka hre reng tawh lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tichuan, sualte ngaihdam a nih tawh si chuan sual tâna thil hlan a ngai tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, unaute u, Isua thisen zârah Hmun Thianghlim Bera luhna kawng thar leh nung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />daidanna puanzâr kal tlangna kawng chu min hawnsak ta a, chu puanzâr chu a taksa kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian chhûngte tân Puithiam Ropui tak kan neih avângin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />sual inthiam lohna rilru sil faisaka awma, kan taksa pawh tuifîma bual faiin, thinlung tak leh rinna nghet tak nên Pathian chu i hnaih ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Beiseina thurin kan pawm hi nghîng lovin i chelh tlat ang u. A tiamtu chu a rinawm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hmangaihna ngah tûr leh thil ṭha ti tûra inchawhthawh dân i ngaihtuah ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ṭhenkhatin inkhâwm thlahthlam an chîng angin chîng ve lo ila, i infuih zâwk ang u; ni chu a lo hnai ta tih in hriat avângin i uar lehzual ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thutak hriatna kan neih tawh hnu pawha kan sual luih zêl si chuan, sualte la bo thei inthawina a awm tawh dâwn lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />rorêlna leh amah dodâltute tiboral tûr Pathian thinurna mei, thlaphâng taka nghah ngawt loh chu hmabâk dang kan nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mosia Dân pawisa lotute chu thuhretu pahnih pathum thuin khawngaihna tel miah lova tihhlum an ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathian Fapa rap beta, thuthlung thisen, amah tihthianghlimna chu thil narâna ruata, khawngaihna Thlarau sawichhetu chu nasa lehzuala hrem tûrah in ngai lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Phuba rêng rêng keima lâk tûr a ni, keimân ka thungrûl ang,” tih leh “Lalpan a mite a ngaihtuah ang,” titu hi kan hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian nung kut tuar chu râpthlâk tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hmâna tihêna in awm hnua hrehawm nasa tak in tuar lai nite kha hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A chângin vântlâng ennawm atân hmuhsit leh tihduhdah in tuar a, a châng phei chuan chutiang tuarte tuarna chu in ṭâwmpui ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kawlbunte chu in lainat a, in thil neih an lâksak che u pawhin lâwm takin in tuar a; thil ṭha zâwk, awm hlen tûr chu in nei tih in hriat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chutichuan, in huaina kha hloh suh u, lâwmman ropui tak a nei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian duhzâwng ti tûr leh a thiltiam dawng tûr chuan in chhel a ngai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Rei lo tê-ah lo kal tûra chu a lo kal dâwn, a muang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Rin vânga thiam ka chantîr chu a nung ang, a hnungtawlh erawh chuan ka rilruin amahah lâwmna rêng a nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Keini zawng boral tûra tawlh kîr thei kan ni tawh lo va, nunna hum tûra rinna chelh tlattute kan ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rinna hi kan beiseite hriat chianna, thil kan hmuh lohte hriatfiahna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rinna thu-ah hian upate kha an fakawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawvêl hi Pathian thu-a siam a nih leh, lang lo aṭangin hmuh theihte hi a lo awm ta tih rinnain kan hmu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abela chuan rinnain Kaina inthawina hlan aia hlu Pathian hnênah a hlân a, a thilhlan chu a lo pawm a, Pathian hmuha mi dik nih a hlawh ta a. Thi tawh mah se rinna avângin thu a la sawi ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Enoka chu rinna avângin thihna tem lova lâk bo a ni a. Pathianin a lâk bo avângin hmuh tûr a awm ta lo. Lâk bo a nih hma khân Pathian a tilâwm tih Lehkha Thu-in a sawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rinna lo chuan Pathian tihlâwm rual a ni lo. Tu pawh Pathian hnêna lo kal chuan Pathian chu a awm ngei a, amah zawngtute tihlawhtlingtu a ni tih an ring tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nova chuan thil lo thleng tûr chungchânga hrilhlâwkna a dawn chu a ngai pawimawh êm êm a, rinnain an chhûngkaw him nân lawng a tu a. Chu chuan khawvêl thiam loh a chantîr a, rinna avânga thiam chantîr a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abrahama chuan a rochun tûr rama kal tûra Pathian kohna chu rinnain a zâwm a, a kalna lam tûr pawh hre lovin a thawk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram tiamah chuan, mi rama châm ang maiin, rinnain a châm ta reng a, thutiam thuhmun a dawnpui tûr, Isaka leh Jakoba nên, puan inah an khawsa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian ruahman leh din, lungphûm nghet tak nei khawpui chu Abrahama hian a nghâk ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sari ngei pawh a ching a, upa lutuk tawh mah se Abrahama chuan rinnain chi thlah theihna a dawng a, thutiam chu a ring tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, thi ang mai ni tawh mah se he mi pakhat aṭang hian chi thlah, vâna arsi anga tam, tuifinriat kama ṭiau chhiar sên loh zât an lo chhuak ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hêngho hi rinna neiin an thi a, thil tiam chu an chang rih lo na a, hla tak aṭangin an lo hmu phâk a, an hlut êm êm a. Leiah hian mikhual leh zin châm mai an ni tih an inhria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutiang mai an nih hriate chuan mahni ram hlun tûr chu an zawng zâwk tih an tilang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An chhuahsan ram kha lungkham ni se kîr lehna hun remchâng an hmu thei ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ram ṭha lehzual, vâna awm chu an ngai zâwk a ni. Tichuan, Pathian pawhin an Pathian nih a zak lo va, an tân khua lam a lo buatsaih tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abrahama chuan, fiaha a awm lai khân a fapa neih chhun Isaka chu rinnain inthawi nân a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thutiam dawngtu a ni a, “Isaka-ah hian i thlahte chhui an ni ang,” tih ni mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian chuan mitthi pawh a kai tho thei ang tih ringin a hlân ta a, thi hnu dam leh ang maiin a hmu kîr leh ta ngei rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rinnain Isaka chuan thil lo la awm tûrahte Jakoba leh Esauva mal a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakoba chuan a thih hma khân Josefa fapate chu rinnain mal a sâwm ve ve a, a tiang rinchhana kûnin Pathian chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josefa chuan a thih a lo hnaih khân Aigupta ram ata Israel thlahte an lo chhuah tûr thu sawiin, rinnain a ruang phûm dân tûr a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosia a pian khân nau hmêlṭha tak a ni tih an hmuhin, a nu leh pain thla thum chhûng rinnain an thukru a, lal thupêk pawh an hlau lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosia chuan, a lo puitlin hnu khân, Farawa fanua fapaa vuah a duh lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />rei lo te atâna sual nawmna chen ai chuan, Pathian mite nêna tihduhdahna tuar rinnain a thlang ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aigupta ram hausakna zawng zawng ai chuan Krista an hmusitna chu ro hlu zâwkah a ngai a, lâwmman a dawn tûr chu a thlîr tlat a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal thinur pawh hlau lovin Aigupta ram chu rinnain a chhuahsan a, Hmuhtheihlohva chu a hmuh avângin chhel takin a tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Rinnain Kalhlên Kût a din a, Tiboraltua khân an fa tîrte a khawih loh nân kawngka biangah thisen a thehtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rinnain Tuipui Senah khân leichâra kal ang maiin an kal kai a. Aigupta miten kai ve an tum khân an tla hlum ta vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rinnain Jeriko kulh chu ni sarih an hual a, a chim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nawhchizuar Rahabi chuan rinnain enthlatute kha lâwm takin a lo thleng a, ring lotute zîngah a boral ve ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka la sawi zêl dâwn em ni? Gideona te, Baraka te, Samsona te, Jeftha te, Davida te, Samuela te leh zâwlneite chanchin sawi dâwn ila hunin mi daih dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chûngte chuan rinnain ram te an la a, thil dik an ti a, thiltiam te an dawng. Sakeibaknei khâ te an tihchihsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />meialh hluah hluahte an timit a, khandaiha thah an pumpelh a, chak lo tê ni mah se tihchak an ni a, indonaah chak tak an ni a, hmêlma kulh an tichim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hmeichhiaten an chhûngte thi lo nung leh an lo lâwm a, a ṭhenin tihduhdah an tuar a, thawhlehna nun hlun an neih theih nân chhan chhuah pawh an duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ṭhenkhatin tihnawmnah leh vuak an tuar a, a ṭhen khaidiata hlina tân ina khung an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat lunga den an ni a, ṭhenkhat thingzainaa zai bun an ni a, a ṭhen berâm leh kêl vun sinin an vâkvai a, tihduhdahin rethei takin hrehawm an tuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chûng mite tân chuan khawvêl hi awmna tlâk a ni lo, thlalêrah te, tlângah te, pûkah te, khuarkhurumah te an vâk an vâk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chuan an rinna avângin fak lo hlawh tawh mah se, thil tiam chu an chang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pathian chuan kan tân thil ṭha lehzual a lo buatsaih tawh a, keini leh anni a ruala tihfamkima kan awm theihna tûrin a lo rêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, chhûmpui nasa tak ang thlîrtuten min hual vêl avângin, min tihnawk thei apiang leh sual min tibuai ṭhînte chu hlîpin, kan hmaa intlânsiaknaah hian chhel takin i tlân zêl ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isua, kan rinna innghahna bul leh tifamkimtu chu i en tlat ang u. Ani pawhin a hmaa lâwmman awm avâng chuan, mualphona chu ngainêpin krawsah chhel takin a tuar a, Pathian lalṭhutthlêng ding lamah chuan a han ṭhu ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutianga mi sualten an dodâlna zawng zawng a tuar chhuah dânte kha ngaihtuah ula; tichuan, in beidawng lo vang a, in chau dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sual dovin thisen chhuak khawpin in la ṭang lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Fate anga zilhna che u thu kha in theihnghilh ta em ni? “Ka fa, Lalpa thununna chu ngainêp suh la, A zilhhauva i awmin hnual hek suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hmangaih chu a thunun ṭhîn a, Fa a lawm apiang chu a vaw ṭhîn,” tih a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thununna chu tuar hrâm hrâm rawh u, fate chunga tih angin Pathianin in chungah a ti a nih hi. Pa thunun loh fa tu nge awm ngai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Faten an hlawh ṭhin Pa thununna chu in hlawh ve loh chuan, fa tak ni lovin sâwn in ni ang asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Min thununtu pa kan nei ṭheuh va, kan zah êm êm si a. Kan nunna tûrin thlarau lama Pa thununna hnuaiah kan kûn lehzual tûr a ni dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan paten ṭha an tih angin rei lo tê chu min thunun ṭhîn ngei tak a, ani erawh chuan a thianghlimna kan chan ve theih nân, kan ṭhatna tûrin min thunun zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thununna rêng rêng hi tuar lai chuan thil lâwmawmah a ngaih theih loh va, hrehawm tak a ni; mahse, insawizawi hnuah chuan rah thlamuanawm tak a chhuah a, mi a siam ṭha ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, in kut awm mai maite hna thawhtîr ula, in khûp zâwi tawhte chu tichak leh ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />kebai sa chu pelhsawlh lova a dam zâwk theih nân in kawngte timâm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng nêna inremna leh thianghlimna ûm rawh u; chumi tel lo chuan tû man Lalpa an hmu thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian khawngaihna tû man an tlûksan loh nân te, in zîngah mi tibuai leh tibawlhhlawh thei rilru chhia a lo chhuah loh nân te fîmkhur ula;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />inngaih chîng te, Esauva anga mi puithu lote tu mah in awm loh nân fîmkhur bawk rawh u. Esauva chuan a fa tîr nihna chu chaw vawi khat eiah a hralh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan a malsâwmna dawn tûr chu a duh leh pawhin hnâwlin a awm ta a, mittui nên ngên mah se tihdanglamna hun a awm tawh lo tih in hriat kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In tlâng thlen hi Sinai tlâng ang a ni lo ve; Sinai tlâng zawng khawih theih a ni a, chu tlâng chu meialh chhuahna, thim chhah mupin a khuh, thlipui tlehna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tawtawrâwt rîk ruai ruaina, au thâwm nasa tak awmna a ni. Chu aw hriate chuan thu dang sawi zêl lo tûrin an ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Sa pawhin tlâng chu a khawih chuan lunga den hlum tûr a ni,” tih thupêk chu an zo lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A hlauhawm êm avângin Mosia pawhin “Hlauvin ka khûr,” a tih hial kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tûnah zawng Zion tlâng Pathian nung khawpui, vân Jerusalem-ah, vântirhkoh sâng tam tak te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />fa tîr kohhran, vâna hming chuang te, mi tin rorêlsaktu Pathian leh tihfamkim tawh mi fel thlarau te inkhâwmpuina hmaah in ding ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abela thisen aia ṭha zâwka thu sawi thei thisen thehtu Isua, thuthlung thar palai hnên in lo thleng ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thu rawn sawitu hi in lo hnar hlauh dah ang e, fîmkhur rawh u. Leia an hnêna thu sawitu lo hnarte mah khân hrem an pumpelh si loh chuan, vân aṭanga thu rawn sawitu kan lo hawisan hlauh chuan hrem kan pumpelh lo lehzual ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan a aw khân lei a nghawr nghîng a, tûnah zawng, “Vawi khat chu lei mai ni lovin, vân pawh ka tinghîng leh dâwn,” tiin a tiam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Vawi khat chu” tih hi thilsiamte chu tihnghîna sawn bo an ni ang a, tihnghîn theih lohte chauh an awm reng dâwn tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, ram tihnghîn theih rual loh kan chan avângin i lâwm ang u, zah tak leh ṭih tak chungin a lâwm zâwngin Pathian rawng i bâwl ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kan Pathian hi mi kâng ral thei mei a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unau inhmangaihna hi uar zêl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mikhual chungah ṭhat chuh ula, chutiang tiin ṭhenkhatten hre lovin vântirhkohte an thleng asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lung in tângte chu tâng ve angin hre reng ula, hrehawm tuarte pawh tisaa awm ve bawk in nih avângin hre reng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Inneih hi mi zawng zawngin chawimawi tûr a ni a, nupa chu rinawm tawn rawh se. Inngaite leh uirete chu Pathianin a ngaihtuah dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sum ngaina mi ni lo ula, in thil neih tâwkah lungawi rawh u. Amah ngeiin, “Engtikah mah ka thlahthlam lo vang che a, kal pawh ka kalsan tawp lo vang che,” a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, “Lalpa chu mi ṭanpuitu a ni a, ka hlau lo vang, Mihringin eng nge min tih theih ang?” kan ti ngam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />In hotute, Pathian thu lo hrilhtu che u chu hre reng ula, an lo khawsak dân ngun taka ngaihtuahin an rin dân zir rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Isua Krista chu niminah nên, vawiinah nên, kumkhua pawhin a pângngai reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zirtîrna chi dang dang leh mak tak tak hruai bovin awm suh ula, Pathian khawngaihna, chhûng lam nun min tichak theitu dawn hi, ei leh in dân kawnga khermei ai chuan a ṭha zâwk a, chutianga khermeite chuan an sâwtpui chuang si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tempula rawngbâwltuten keini maichâmah chuan an ei ve a thiang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puithiam lalberin ran thisen chu sual thawi nâna hlan tûrin Hmun Thianghlim Berah a luhpui a; mahse, ran ruangte chu kulh pâwnah an hâl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, Isua pawhin, ama thisen ngeia mite a tihthianghlim theih nân khawpui pâwnah a lo tuar ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, amah an hmuhsitna chu phurin, a hnênah kulh pâwnah i kal chhuak ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leiah hian kan tân khaw hlun a awm lo va, khaw lo la awm tûr kan zawng zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, ama zâra fakna inthawina chu Pathian hnênah i hlân fo vang u, a hming kan ṭan apiangin fakna inthawina chu kan hlân ṭhîn a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, thil ṭha tih leh inṭanpui tawn hi theihnghilh suh u, chu chu Pathian lâwmzâwng inthawina chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In hotute thu awih ula, an thu thuin awm rawh u. Mutmu pawh tuah thei lovin in thlarau nun an vênsak che u a, Pathian hnêna in chungchâng sawitu tûr an ni. An thu in awih chuan hlim takin an thawk ang a, in awih loh chuan hrehawm ti takin an thawk ang, chu chu in tân a sâwt hek lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi ṭawngṭaisak fo rawh u; eng lai pawhin thil ṭha tih kan duh avângin chhia leh ṭha hriatna thiang tak kan nei tih kan inhria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In hnênah Pathianin mi tirh kîr leh thuai theih nân min ṭawngṭaisak tûrin ka ngên chiam a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Berâmpu ropui, kan Lalpa Isua chu mitthi zîng ata hruai chhuaktu remna Pathian chuan, chatuan thuthlunna thisen avâng chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a duhzâwng ti thei tûrin thil ṭha tinrêngin thuam famkim che u sela, Isua Krista zârah a lâwmzâwng ang taka awm tûrin min siam sela, Krista hnênah chuan chatuanin ropuina awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Unaute u, he fuihna thu hi ngai thei hrâm hrâm tûrin ka ngên a che u, ka lehkhathawn che u hi tawi tê chauh a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kan unaupa Timothea kha lung in ata an chhuah ta tih lo hre rawh u, a lo thlen hman chuan ka rualin ka rawn hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />In hotu zawng zawng leh mi thianghlim zawng zawng kha chibai mi bûksak ang che u. Itali rama mite hian chibai an bûk a che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />In zaa hnênah khawngaihna awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
